    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tires in the afternoon; weight down about 2 kg since diagnosis</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No vision change</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Slight slurring when tired; no choking or drooling</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No breathlessness, including lying flat</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No constipation or heartburn</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Cramps in the calves some nights, eased by stretching; ankle healed</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No skin breakdown under the orthosis</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Hand and left ankle weakness, slowly worse; no numbness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steady; PHQ-2 score 1</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
